<InstitutionalPage
  title="Advertise"
  eyebrow="Commercial"
  description="Nuvellum handles advertising and sponsorship with clear labeling and separation from editorial judgment."
  intro="Commercial opportunities are handled case by case, with transparent labeling and a clear boundary between paid partnerships and independent editorial work."
  note="For current availability, contact sam@nuvellum.news."
>
  <h2>Commercial formats</h2>
  <p>Opportunities may include premium display placements, section sponsorships, newsletter sponsorships and clearly labeled branded content. Availability depends on current inventory, format and editorial fit.</p>
  <h2>Editorial separation</h2>
  <p>Payment does not buy favorable coverage, story suppression or undisclosed editorial treatment. Sponsored or branded material should be recognizable as commercial material before a reader engages with it.</p>
  <h2>Measurement</h2>
  <p>Commercial materials should describe the metrics the publication can actually measure. Nuvellum does not promise traffic, engagement or outcomes that cannot be supported by its analytics.</p>
  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>For advertising, sponsorship, partnerships or rights enquiries, email <a href="mailto:sam@nuvellum.news?subject=Advertising%20and%20partnerships">sam@nuvellum.news</a>.</p>
</InstitutionalPage>
